<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Mineral deposit located -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_LetterLabelFoundDeposit>鉱床を発見</LocalMineralScanner_LetterLabelFoundDeposit>
  <!-- EN: {FINDER_nameDef} has located a deposit of {0} in an undiscovered area using the local mineral scanner. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_LetterFoundDeposit>{FINDER_nameDef}は近距離鉱物探査スキャナーを使用して,未知の区域で{0}鉱床を発見した.</LocalMineralScanner_LetterFoundDeposit>
  <!-- EN: No more undiscovered {0} deposits remain on this map. The local mineral scanner will remain idle until it is tuned to another mineral. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_MessageExhausted>このマップには,これ以上未知の{0}鉱床は残っていません.近距離鉱物探査スキャナーは,別の鉱物に調整されるまで待機します.</LocalMineralScanner_MessageExhausted>
  <!-- EN: no undiscovered {0} deposits left -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_NoFoggedDeposits>未知の{0}鉱床が残っていない</LocalMineralScanner_NoFoggedDeposits>
  <!-- EN: none undiscovered -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_NoneUndiscovered>未知なし</LocalMineralScanner_NoneUndiscovered>
  <!-- EN: Combined scanning speed ({0} operators) -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_CombinedScanSpeed>合計スキャン速度(オペレーター{0}人)</LocalMineralScanner_CombinedScanSpeed>

  <!-- Ancient cryptosleep caskets (opt-in target). The letter's {0} arrives with its article
       ("an ancient cryptosleep casket"); the other two take the bare label ("ancient
       cryptosleep casket"), whose grammatical gender can differ between casket variants.
       NoFoggedCaskets is a lower-case fragment like NoFoggedDeposits. The letter stays neutral: caskets also sit in ruins
       and quest structures that hold nothing dangerous, so it must not call them a danger. -->
  <!-- EN: Casket located -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_LetterLabelFoundCasket>冬眠カプセルを発見</LocalMineralScanner_LetterLabelFoundCasket>
  <!-- EN: {FINDER_nameDef} has located {0} in an undiscovered area using the local mineral scanner. What it holds, and what else lies nearby, will only be known once the area is explored. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_LetterFoundCasket>{FINDER_nameDef}は近距離鉱物探査スキャナーを使用して,未知の区域で{0}を発見した.中身と周辺に何があるかは,その区域を探索するまで分からない.</LocalMineralScanner_LetterFoundCasket>
  <!-- EN: No undiscovered {0} remains on this map. The local mineral scanner will remain idle until it is tuned to something else. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_MessageExhaustedCaskets>このマップには,これ以上未知の{0}は残っていません.近距離鉱物探査スキャナーは,別の対象に調整されるまで待機します.</LocalMineralScanner_MessageExhaustedCaskets>
  <!-- EN: no undiscovered {0} left -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_NoFoggedCaskets>未知の{0}が残っていない</LocalMineralScanner_NoFoggedCaskets>
  <!-- Shown in place of NoFoggedCaskets / NoneUndiscovered for a scanner still tuned to a
       casket after the setting is turned off. Lower-case fragment. -->
  <!-- EN: disabled in mod settings -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_CasketsDisabled>MOD設定で無効化されている</LocalMineralScanner_CasketsDisabled>

  <!-- Settings window. *Desc keys are hover tooltips. SettingsCategory is also the Workshop
       title and must equal the first line of .steamworkshop/Description/<Language>.txt. -->
  <!-- EN: Local Mineral Scanner -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_SettingsCategory>近距離鉱物探査スキャナー</LocalMineralScanner_SettingsCategory>
  <!-- EN: Placement -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_SettingsPlacement>設置</LocalMineralScanner_SettingsPlacement>
  <!-- EN: Scanning -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_SettingsScanning>スキャン</LocalMineralScanner_SettingsScanning>
  <!-- Appended to a slider label; keep the leading space. VanillaSuffix marks a value one of
       vanilla's scanners uses; {0} = that scanner's label. -->
  <!-- EN:  (default) -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_DefaultSuffix> (デフォルト)</LocalMineralScanner_DefaultSuffix>
  <!-- EN:  ({0}) -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_VanillaSuffix> ({0})</LocalMineralScanner_VanillaSuffix>

  <!-- {0} = vanilla building label (long-range mineral scanner / deep drill). -->
  <!-- EN: Doesn't work under a roof -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_RequireUnroofed>屋根の下では機能しない</LocalMineralScanner_RequireUnroofed>
  <!-- EN: Like the {0}, it can't be placed or operated under a roof. Turn off to allow. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_RequireUnroofedDesc>{0}と同様に,屋根の下では設置も稼働もできません.オフにすると許可されます.</LocalMineralScanner_RequireUnroofedDesc>
  <!-- EN: Can be uninstalled -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_Minifiable>撤去可能</LocalMineralScanner_Minifiable>
  <!-- EN: Lets the scanner be uninstalled and moved, like the {0}. Turn off and it can only be deconstructed. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_MinifiableDesc>{0}と同様に,スキャナーを撤去して移動できるようにします.オフにすると解体のみ可能になります.</LocalMineralScanner_MinifiableDesc>
  <!-- EN: Weight of the uninstalled scanner when hauled or carried by a caravan. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_MassDesc>撤去したスキャナーを運搬したり,キャラバン隊で持ち運んだりする際の重量です.</LocalMineralScanner_MassDesc>

  <!-- {0} = the long-range mineral scanner's label, {1} = its own value for this setting. -->
  <!-- EN: Average working days between finds for one operator at 100% research speed. The {0} uses {1}. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_FindMtbDaysDesc>研究速度100%のオペレーター1人あたりの,発見までの平均稼働日数です.{0}は{1}を使用しています.</LocalMineralScanner_FindMtbDaysDesc>
  <!-- EN: Guaranteed find within -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_FindGuaranteedDays>確実な発見まで</LocalMineralScanner_FindGuaranteedDays>
  <!-- EN: Working days after which a find is guaranteed, for one operator at 100% research speed. The {0} uses {1}. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_FindGuaranteedDaysDesc>研究速度100%のオペレーター1人が確実に発見できるようになるまでの稼働日数です.{0}は{1}を使用しています.</LocalMineralScanner_FindGuaranteedDaysDesc>

  <!-- {0} = the vanilla ancient cryptosleep casket's label. -->
  <!-- EN: Can scan for ancient cryptosleep caskets -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_ScanAncientCaskets>古代の冬眠カプセルをスキャン可能</LocalMineralScanner_ScanAncientCaskets>
  <!-- EN: Lists the {0} and its variants in the tuning menu whenever the map holds any, so the scanner can reveal one sealed inside an undiscovered structure such as an ancient danger. Revealing a casket does not wake whatever lies dormant nearby. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_ScanAncientCasketsDesc>マップ上に存在する場合に限り,調整メニューに{0}とその派生型を表示します.これにより,太古の脅威のような未知の構造物の中に封じられたカプセルを,スキャナーで発見できるようになります.カプセルを発見しても,近くで休眠しているものが目を覚ますことはありません.</LocalMineralScanner_ScanAncientCasketsDesc>

  <!-- {0} = resource label (lower case, row is CapitalizeFirst()ed), {1} = count. -->
  <!-- EN: {0} cost: {1} -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_ResourceCost>{0}のコスト: {1}</LocalMineralScanner_ResourceCost>
  <!-- EN: Amount of {0} needed to build one scanner. 0 removes it from the cost. -->
  <LocalMineralScanner_ResourceCostDesc>スキャナーを1台建造するために必要な{0}の量です.0にするとコストから除外されます.</LocalMineralScanner_ResourceCostDesc>
</LanguageData>
